1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,200
This is Mindspace.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:06,000
Everything I save in a day
lands in one place.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,600
One note, four captures.

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,600
A voice memo, a paragraph I clipped,
a screenshot,

5
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,000
and what I thought about each.

6
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:17,600
Gemini reads the whole note
and writes it up.

7
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:21,000
My own notes stay beside it.

8
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:24,300
I am building this pitch right now,

9
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:27,000
and that is worth keeping too.

10
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:30,300
So the moon catches it,

11
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:33,000
without pulling me out of the work.

12
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,300
This is where it goes.

13
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:37,300
Mind, the twin.

14
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:41,000
Folders become arcs, sized by
how much lives in each.

15
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:43,300
Speech is on device.

16
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:45,500
It transcribes while I talk,

17
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,000
so spoken thoughts land
in the same place.

18
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:50,300
Which is the point.

19
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:53,300
Everything I saved
and everything I thought,

20
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:56,000
in one place I can talk to.

21
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:59,800
Imagine you could Cmd + F your brain.
